<p>qaid qaane me talaatum hai ke hind aati hai<br />
duqtar-e- faatema ghirat se muee jaati hai<br />
rooh qaalib me woh zindaan me ghabraati hai<br />
be hawaasi se har ek baar woh chillaati hai</p>

<p>aasmaa'n door zamin saqt khidhar jaau'n mai<br />
bibiyo milke duaa maango ke mar jaau'n mai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kya karu kya na karu jald bataao logo<br />
sadqa akbar ka hiqaarat se bachaao logo<br />
ooth karke ho khade mujh ko chupaao logo<br />
ya kisi goshe me le jaake bithaao logo</p>

<p>sar khuli hu kisi hujre me mujhe bandh karo<br />
hind aati hai mujhe qaak ka paiwand karo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kis tarha hind ke aane se na ghabraau'n mai<br />
bint-e- hyder hoo'n na kyu qaid me sharmaau'n mai<br />
koi deewaar jo shaq ho to samaa jaau'n mai<br />
seedhe maajaaye ke maqtal ko chali jaau'n mai</p>

<p>karbala me na yeh zillat hai na ruswaai hai<br />
be ridaa mai hu to be gor mera bhai hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naagahaa fizza ne di ahle- haram ko ye qabar<br />
hind aati hai bade jaaho- tahammul se idhar<br />
beeraqe'n naqra-o- zar ki hai juloo ke andar<br />
sab kaneeze'n to ridaa odhi hai wo nange sar</p>

<p>par sawaari bahut aahista rawaa'n hoti hai<br />
har qadam hind tehar jaati hai aur roti hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kehti hai qaidiyo'n ke shor-e bukaa ne maara<br />
mujh ko is haaye hussaina ki sadaa ne maara<br />
inke sardaar ko kis ehl-e- jafaa ne maara<br />
kya wo syed tha jise ehl-e- dagha ne maara</p>

<p>ek bijli si kaleje pe mere girti hai<br />
nange sar fatima aankho'n ke tale phirti hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hogaya zibha koi qaasa-e- baari logo<br />
ins-o- jin hoor-o- malak karte hai zaari logo<br />
lechalo soo-e- najaf meri sawaari logo<br />
hogi mushkil wahi'n aasaan hamaari logo</p>

<p>qair se hai mere aaqa to wo sote honge<br />
warna marqad me ali bete ko rote honge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dar-e- zindaan pa huwa itne me amboh kamaal<br />
bole darbaan badhe doulat-o- umr-o- iqbaal<br />
qaidiyo uttho adab se karo sab isteqbaal<br />
zan-e- haakim ka hai zindaa'n me nuzool-o- ajlaal</p>

<p>qasr-e- shaahi se jo tashreef yahaa'n laati hai<br />
parwarish karne ko tum sab ki huzoor aati hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sab ne mu karke soo-e- hind ye ki nouha gari<br />
dekhiye shaam ke zindaa'n me chiraaghe sahari<br />
yaade qaaliq me jo hai qalq se hai be qabari<br />
kyu musalsil kiya ye to hai adam ka safari</p>

<p>kis ne dam band kiya touq-e- jafaa se iska<br />
silsila milta hai kuch sher-e quda se iska<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>gird aabid ke phiri hind ba haal-e-tagheer<br />
rakh diya paau'n pa sar apna hataa kar zanjeer<br />
bole wo kaun hai boli ke kaneez-e- shabbir<br />
assalaam aye rasan-o- touq-o- salaasal ke aseer</p>

<p>hai wasiyyat ka mahal marne pa tayyar hai tu<br />
kuch kafan ke liye rakhta hai ke naadaar hai tu<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>gham na kar gor-o- kafan mai tujhe doongi lillah<br />
nange sar tere janaaze ke chaloongi hamraah<br />
marne waale teraa kya naam hai kab se hai tabaah<br />
bole moula abhi chaalees baras jeena hai aah</p>

<p>naam bekas bhi hai qaidi bhi hai naadaar bhi hai<br />
haal yeh hai ke aseeri bhi hai aazaar bhi hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hind ne poocha maraz kya hai kaha bepidari<br />
roke wo boli dawaa kya hai kaha nouhagari<br />
ghar ko daryaaft kiya kahne laga darbadari<br />
boli leta hai qabar koun kaha be qabari</p>

<p>aah karne ka sabab poocha to sharmaane lage<br />
taaziyaanou ke nashaa'n pusht pa dikhlaane lage<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>